To Run Project Locally:
1) enter virtual envrionment and navigate to scripts folder:
    A) .venv\Scripts\activate.bat
    B) cd scripts
2) run picture to mosiac script
    B) Python picToMosiac.py
3) upload order list to LEGO website
    A) go to https://www.lego.com/en-us/pick-and-build/pick-a-brick
    B) click "Upload List"
    C) upload the jsons in the OrderLists folder
    D) click "View All Pieces"
    E) Click "Pick Selected Pieces
    F) Check out and buy all the uploaded pieces from the order lists
4) Follow the instructions
    A) go to the InstructionSets folder



To Test/View API endpoints
1) run uvicorn fastapi
    A) uvicorn Main:app --reload
2) go to fast api local ui
    A) navigate to http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs#/ in a browser
2) enter information into a endpoint
    A) example: generate (POST) could accept the following:
    {
        "image_path": "C:/Users/bgern/Desktop/AIEng/LAIGO/images/stella1.jpg",
        "settings": {
            "mosiac_block_width": 1,
            "mosaic_type": "2d",
            "background_color_percent": 100,
            "to_frame": true
        }
    }